      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "YOLOv4 object detection, rebuilt from GENERIC cv2.dnn nodes\n\nReproduces the all-in-one 'CV YOLOv4 Detect' node's results with NO model-specific monolith. The 'YOLOv4 Detection' subgraph decomposes the pipeline:\n\n  DNN Letterbox        (aspect-preserving resize + 114 pad to 608)\n  DNN Blob From Image  (scale 1/255, BGR->RGB)\n  DNN Forward All      (loads yolov4.onnx, returns boxes + confs)\n  DNN Pick Output x2   (by INDEX: boxes (1,N,1,4) at idx 0, confs (1,N,C) at idx 1 - shape heuristics don't work for YOLOv4's 4-D outputs)\n  YOLO Detect Decode   (layout 'separate boxes + confs (NMS)': unwraps normalized xyxy boxes + per-class confidences, applies NMS)\n\nClass names are NOT baked in: 'CV Load Labels' reads models/labels/coco-labels-2014_2017.txt (line N = class id N) and feeds the decoder. To adapt to another YOLO model: swap the model combo + layout dropdown inside the subgraph. Put yolov4.onnx in models/onnx. Zero detections is a valid result (found=false, empty outputs)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
